{"url": "https://x.com/mikepat711/status/2090422774825202020", "id": "2090422774825202020", "text": "Grok Bot is amazing, holy F. \n\nMy Grok Bot finished cleaning my 100,000 unread email inbox mess, and is now going through and unsubscribing me from all of the junk responsible for making the mess in the first place. Here are two screenshots below; one of my Grok Bot giving me the play-by-play, and another of the Bot's linux machine, where it is on Chrome physically unsubscribing from everything for me. When it can't complete execution, it just tells me to jump onto the chrome browser and do the final click.  But it has completed most of them autonomously. \n\nTruly epic.", "raw_text": {"text": "Grok Bot is amazing, holy F. \n\nMy Grok Bot finished cleaning my 100,000 unread email inbox mess, and is now going through and unsubscribing me from all of the junk responsible for making the mess in the first place. Here are two screenshots below; one of my Grok Bot giving me the play-by-play, and another of the Bot's linux machine, where it is on Chrome physically unsubscribing from everything for me. When it can't complete execution, it just tells me to jump onto the chrome browser and do the final click.  But it has completed most of them autonomously. \n\nTruly epic.", "display_text_range": [0, 575], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [281, 304], "id": "2090421711107674112", "display": "pic.x.com/fkRwwdpPWt", "original": "https://t.co/fkRwwdpPWt", "replacement": "https://x.com/mikepat711/status/2090422774825202020/photo/1"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [281, 304], "id": "2090422315641151488", "display": "pic.x.com/fkRwwdpPWt", "original": "https://t.co/fkRwwdpPWt", "replacement": "https://x.com/mikepat711/status/2090422774825202020/photo/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "mikepat711", "url": "https://x.com/mikepat711", "id": "481812746", "followers": 20483, "following": 3490, "likes": 202178, "media_count": 3621, "name": "Mike P", "description": "Shitposting, PhD.